
My name is TTP. 

I was born with neurological impairment/challenges, quadra para plegic, diagonosed later as mixed cerebral palsy. It affects every cell of my body and crippled them.

A key feature of it is the impact it has on your informational processing systems. How you process information in your brain and the rest of your body and your body sends information back.

So by that standard, I should be a dumbass, I should be invalid.

Instead I was given the oppurtunity to know life. To celebrate both the joy and the sadness with my mental health. I do it in a spotlight and I invite all those who are willing to join me,

I have programmed/written things since 1989. 

On this site you will find collections of writings, mainly about video games but I do try to cover other topics and other areas of interest. 

I have a big interest in human interest stories and things that can serve to inspire myself and others.

